  "copy": [
    {
      "text": "Experienced travellers know that's the time to take the most in. And put the least out. You see our",
      "x": 34,
      "baseline": 22.0,
      "width": 268
    },
    {
      "text": "off season rates can land you in hot springs retreats, guest ranches, fishing hide-a-ways and hotels with",
      "x": 19,
      "baseline": 29.1,
      "width": 282
    },
    {
      "text": "incredible mountains and bay side views. Of course our attractions are uncrowded in Spring and more",
      "x": 19,
      "baseline": 36.2,
      "width": 281
    },
    {
      "text": "attractive than ever. So join the whales in Johnstone Strait. Or why not try river rafting, island hopping,",
      "x": 19,
      "baseline": 43.3,
      "width": 280
    },
    {
      "text": "mountain trekking, Spring skiing, popping in to shows, shops and cafés right here, right now. Down the",
      "x": 322,
      "baseline": 22.1,
      "width": 284
    },
    {
      "text": "road there's even more to come as Expo 86, our world exposition takes shape. Take in our early Spring",
      "x": 322,
      "baseline": 29.2,
      "width": 284
    },
    {
      "text": "this year. You'll be back again. For travel planning information write Tourism British Columbia, Dept.",
      "x": 322,
      "baseline": 36.3,
      "width": 266
    },
    {
      "text": "1117 Wharf Street, Victoria, B.C. V8W 2Z2.",
      "x": 322,
      "baseline": 43.4,
      "width": 123
    }
  ],
